---
// Inert demonstration of the conversational connection builder. Colors, chat
// hierarchy and rounded bubbles follow the real yaAgents connection capture;
// message structure also follows BuildChat.tsx / styles.css in _wt/yapt1124.
// The API already exists. These messages illustrate configuration, not a live run.
---
<div class="ocb-screen" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="ocb-heading"><span>‹ Conexões</span><strong>API de pedidos</strong></div>
  <div class="ocb-thread">
    <p class="ocb-note">Demonstração · API existente</p>
    <div class="ocb-message ocb-message--user">Conecte nossa API de pedidos. Quero consultar status e previsão de entrega pelo número do pedido.</div>
    <div class="ocb-message ocb-message--assistant">Preparei a conexão com a capacidade <strong>Consultar pedido</strong>. Revise o acesso e teste a consulta para usar com agentes e atendentes.</div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .ocb-screen{position:absolute;inset:0;width:1120px;height:700px;background:#faf9f5;color:#26241c;font-family:Inter,sans-serif}
  .ocb-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;height:72px;padding:0 38px;border-bottom:1px solid #e7e4da;background:#fff;font-size:21px}.ocb-heading>span{color:#128a7e}.ocb-heading>strong{font-size:25px;font-weight:600}
  .ocb-thread{position:absolute;left:350px;top:166px;width:420px}
  .ocb-note{margin:0 0 10px;text-align:center;font-size:18px;line-height:1.3;color:#827d6e}
  .ocb-message{box-sizing:border-box;max-width:420px;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:14px;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .ocb-message--user{margin:0 0 12px;background:#128a7e;color:white;border-bottom-right-radius:4px}
  .ocb-message--assistant{background:#f2f0e9;border-top-left-radius:4px}.ocb-message strong{font-weight:700}
</style>
